# Lint toolchain for the hook sources and managed assets (scripts/test_emitted_hook_lint.py) and the
# portability job's yamllint, one exact pin each. requirements.txt is the lock
# compiled from this file: every package the gate installs, pinned with hashes. Change a
# pin here, then regenerate the lock from this directory with the command recorded in the
# requirements.txt header (Renovate runs the same command). Keep '=' between each option
# and its argument: Renovate skips a lock whose header separates them with a space.
